{{!
    @template local_dimensions/status_badges

    The status pills other plugins add beside a competency through the competency_status_badges hook,
    a partial of the plan overview's accordion header and of the hero header. Plain text only and no
    link: the accordion header is a button. Nothing is drawn when no plugin added a pill.

    Context variables required:
    * statusbadges (array) - The pills; each has label (plain text, escaped here) and tone (one of
      success, warning, danger, info, neutral)

    @copyright  2026 Anderson Blaine
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "statusbadges": [
            {"label": "Validity: Compliant", "tone": "success"},
            {"label": "Validity: Due soon, 2027-03-01", "tone": "warning"}
        ]
    }
}}
{{#statusbadges}}<span class="local-dimensions-grade-badge local-dimensions-status-badge local-dimensions-status-badge-{{tone}}" data-region="status-badge">{{label}}</span>{{/statusbadges}}
